 "notes": [
  "Posted 6 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The post calls the deck SYC, but the Objective Set Your Course For Alderaan / The Ultimate Power In The Universe is not in the posted list; the sections add up to 60 without it, so no Objective row is added and the starting card is the Death Star system.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (7)': Death Star ('DS'), Death Star: Docking Bay 327 ('DSDB'), Alderaan, Prepared Defenses ('Prepared D'), Mobilization Points, Oppressive Enforcement ('OE') and A Million Voices Crying Out; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'OE' dested Oppressive Enforcement (the strategy: 'OE- 2 destiny star destroyers is better than one'; it makes Imperial capital starships destiny +1).",
  "Posted 'Maul' dested the Tatooine Darth Maul (the only Maul character of the time); 'The Stick of Maul' dested Maul's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'DVEPP' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber (the Enhanced Premiere Pack Vader); 'Chiranue' dested Admiral Chiraneau; 'Trawn' dested Grand Admiral Thrawn.",
  "Posted 'Rebel Barrier X 2' in a Dark deck dested the Dark counterpart Imperial Barrier.",
  "Posted 'TWBHTP' dested There'll Be Hell To Pay; 'PASOA' dested Put All Sections On Alert; 'Super Lazer' dested Superlaser.",
  "The 'Big Blue(10)' header (the Star Destroyers) is a section name, not a card.",
  "The description and strategy call the deck undefeated in tournaments and playtesting; no event is named, so it stays a general deck.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
 ],
